<view class="cm-page cm-scope cm-with-footer cm-address-edit"><view class="cm-edit-intro"><view class="cm-h1">把好礼，送到这里。</view><view class="cm-p">请填写可以联系到你的收货信息。</view></view><view class="card cm-address-form"><text class="cm-input-label">收货人</text><input class="cm-field" value="{{name}}" maxlength="40" bindinput="onName" placeholder="请填写收货人姓名" disabled="{{saving}}"/><text class="cm-input-label">手机号码</text><input class="cm-field" value="{{phone}}" type="number" maxlength="11" bindinput="onPhone" placeholder="请填写配送联系电话" disabled="{{saving}}"/><text class="cm-input-label">所在地区</text><picker mode="region" value="{{region}}" bindchange="onRegion" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="cm-field cm-field-region"><text>{{regionDisplay||'请选择省 / 市 / 区'}}</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="30"/></view></picker><text class="cm-input-label">详细地址</text><textarea class="cm-field cm-textarea" value="{{detail}}" maxlength="180" bindinput="onDetail" placeholder="请填写街道、小区、楼栋及门牌号" disabled="{{saving}}"/><view class="cm-default-switch"><view><text class="cm-b">设为默认收货地址</text><text>下次兑换时优先选择</text></view><switch color="#D4113A" checked="{{isDefault}}" bindchange="onDefault" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view></view><view class="cm-form-note"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="muted" size="36"/><view class="cm-p">收货信息用于商品寄送与本机地址管理，<text>请核对姓名、手机号码和详细地址。</text></view></view><view class="cm-action-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="onSave" disabled="{{saving}}" loading="{{saving}}">保存收货地址</button></view></view>
